mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[825,826,827,838,845,856],"ol",{},[802,828,829,830,833,834,837],{},"Use a real ",[298,831,832],{},"test_"," key in ",[298,835,836],{},"VATLY_API_KEY",", with customers and catalogue IDs\nfrom that same storefront\u002Fmode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[802,839,840,841,844],{},"Run your server locally. Expose only its webhook route with an HTTPS tunnel,\nregister that public URL as a webhook endpoint, and store its signing secret\nas ",[298,842,843],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",". A Vatly server cannot call your localhost directly.",[802,846,847,848,851,852,855],{},"Create a checkout and pay through the hosted test flow. Retain checkout\u002Forder\nIDs and inspect verified ",[298,849,850],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[298,853,854],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[802,857,858],{},"Confirm duplicate delivery is harmless and failed work stays retryable. Do not\ninfer payment from a redirect alone. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing a tunnel; keep a record of test resources you create.",[286,860,861,864,865,868,869,458,872,868,875,868,878,881,882,885,886,889,890,894],{},[298,862,863],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[298,866,867],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[298,870,871],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[298,873,874],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[298,876,877],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[298,879,880],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[298,883,884],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[298,887,888],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". ",[891,892,893],"strong",{},"These mutate account data.","\nUse only with explicit permission and disposable test resources, never existing\nsubscriptions\u002Forders just because a key is in test mode. Mode assertions on a\ncheckout builder do not turn a live key into a test key.",[290,896,898],{"id":897},"run-this-packages-checks","Run this package's checks",[303,900,904],{"className":901,"code":902,"language":903,"meta":308,"style":308},"language-sh shiki shiki-themes material-theme-